[32m+[m[32m## Data Model[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe application uses a structured reporting model built around stations, templates, reports, versions, and reconciliation data.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mKey entities include:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `users` — user profiles and subscription status[m
[32m+[m[32m- `stations` — church station information[m
[32m+[m[32m- `delegate_pairing_codes` — temporary delegate-linking codes[m
[32m+[m[32m- `templates` — report template definitions[m
[32m+[m[32m- `template_versions` — template version history[m
[32m+[m[32m- `template_field_mappings` — mappings between Excel cells and canonical fields[m
[32m+[m[32m- `data_fields` — canonical field registry[m
[32m+[m[32m- `expenditure_categories` — user-defined expenditure categories[m
[32m+[m[32m- `reports` — logical report records[m
[32m+[m[32m- `report_versions` — versioned report data and audit trail[m
[32m+[m[32m- `bank_statements` — uploaded statements and OCR results[m
[32m+[m[32m- `discrepancy_flags` — reconciliation discrepancies[m
